<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-kikkawai-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila kikkawai Turing wavelength at 2.3 µm (detail, 0 Ma) — Code-to-model traceability: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Jacobian, integrator, mode assay, ablation, and render are separate functions. Lean theorems state the wavelength order, the mode count, the diffusion gap, and the dark-morph activator inequality. The render weights are constants inside render_gif rather than entries read back from the reference JSON." ;
